<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "NAACP lawyers file Davis v. County School Board of Prince Edward County, later joined to Brown." .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1951-05-23"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
