<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Supreme Court hears the first arguments in the consolidated school cases." .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1952-12-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reargument begins on questions the Court posed, including the history of the Fourteenth Amendment and possible remedies." .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1953-12-07"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Court rules unanimously that segregated public schools violate the Equal Protection Clause; Bolling v. Sharpe is decided the same day." .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1954-05-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "In Brown II the Court orders desegregation to proceed with all deliberate speed under federal district courts." .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/brown-v-board-of-education/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1955-05-31"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
