<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/japanese-american-incarceration/timeline/11> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tule Lake closes, the last of the ten WRA camps; the WRA is disbanded on June 30, 1946." .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/japanese-american-incarceration/timeline/11> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1946-03-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
