<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/japanese-american-incarceration/timeline/13> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "President Ronald Reagan signs the Civil Liberties Act of 1988, with an apology and $20,000 for each surviving incarcerated person." .
