<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jim-crow-laws/timeline/13> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "President Johnson signs the Voting Rights Act." .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jim-crow-laws/timeline/13> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1965-08-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
