<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Virginia planter, lawyer and founder (1743–1826) who drafted the Declaration of Independence, wrote Virginia's statute for religious freedom, served as secretary of state and vice president, and was the third president of the United States (1801–1809), while holding more than 600 people in slavery over his lifetime." .
