<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#timelineEntry> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson/timeline/8> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#timelineEntry> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson/timeline/9> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <https://schema.org/birthDate> "1743-04-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <https://schema.org/deathDate> "1826-07-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thomas-jefferson> <https://schema.org/endDate> "1826-07-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
